+    // Brain Engine 0051: lay group bw_g's banks out slot by slot (slot s of every bank side by side), so the slots a
+    // read borrows come from every bank alike and the whole group can be lent, not just its first bank. The banks then
+    // have one stride (the bytes of a slot of all of them); runs of slots are copied one slot at a time.
